`image.adjustments.curves` with the `eyedropper` param (the Curves dialog's Set Black/Neutral Gray/White Point, as an agent or the CLI sends it) does nothing on a smart object.

Steps (engine, on `main`):

```
file.new {"width":8,"height":8}
edit.fill {"color":[0.6,0.5,0.4]}
layer.smartObjects.convertToSmartObject {}
image.adjustments.curves {"eyedropper":{"point":"white","at":[2,2]}}
